    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Folio is a modern, minimal, and visually engaging WordPress theme designed to showcase content with clarity and style. Built with a clean layout and elegant typography, it is ideal for creatives, agencies, portfolios, and businesses looking to present their work in a professional and impactful way. As a child theme of WENS Haelo, it inherits powerful core features and stability while offering a refined, portfolio-focused design. The theme fully supports the WordPress block editor (Full Site Editing), allowing you to customize headers, footers, templates, and layouts without any coding. It is fully responsive and optimized for performance, ensuring a smooth experience across all devices. With its portfolio-ready design and flexible layout options, WENS Folio is well-suited for displaying projects, services, or even travel packages in an attractive and organized manner. Its lightweight structure and easy customization make it a reliable choice for building professional websites quickly and efficiently."
    },
